### Variables
@baseUrl = https://wqgu3ua2he.execute-api.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/Prod
@apiPath = /getCallsInSystem
# https://wqgu3ua2he.execute-api.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/Prod/getCallsInSystem
#https://wqgu3ua2he.execute-api.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/Prod/getCallsInSystem
### Get Callbacks - Primera página (sin paginación)
POST {{baseUrl}}{{apiPath}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "page_size": 100
}

### Get Callbacks - Con paginación (segunda página)
# Reemplaza el next_page_token con el valor real de la respuesta anterior
POST {{baseUrl}}{{apiPath}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "page_size": 100,
  "next_page_token": [
    {
      "status": "PENDING",
      "offset": {
        "status": "PENDING",
        "call_at": "2024-01-01T00:00:00Z",
        "contact_id_inbound": "3e724687-a280-447a-810d-asdasd"
      }
    }
  ]
}

### Get Callbacks - Página grande (1000 items)
POST {{baseUrl}}{{apiPath}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "page_size": 1000
}

### Get Callbacks - Últimos 60 días (agosto-septiembre)
# El Lambda buscará automáticamente desde hace 60 días hasta hoy
POST {{baseUrl}}{{apiPath}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "page_size": 1000
}

### Get Callbacks - Fecha específica (2025-09-15)
POST {{baseUrl}}{{apiPath}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "page_size": 100,
  "start_date": "2025-09-15"
}

### Get Callbacks - Rango de fechas (agosto-septiembre)
POST {{baseUrl}}{{apiPath}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "page_size": 1000,
  "start_date": "2025-08-01",
  "end_date": "2025-09-30"
}

